  "bodyHash": "be6c867fa0b2f685",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1193609/description_122f3a7c-71cf-4a91-96fc-2b8a9f0410df.png\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1193609/description_ac9d3128-92f8-41b9-801b-6ca0956c49df.png\"><br><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1193609/description_1c596789-1104-4453-b423-ee39006aec0f.png\"><span style=\"color:#3db2ff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1193609/description_f6949be7-ac0f-480c-95fc-301d711d60cc.png\"><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n'<span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/a-shattered-prophecy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">破碎的預言</span></a></em></span></span>' 是一款以 <span style=\"color:#fff\">ARG</span> 為主題的沉浸式模組包，您可以在全球 YouTube 上觀看相關內容<span style=\"color:#707070\"><br>以及 '<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-broken-script-official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">破碎的腳本</span></em></a></span>' (SAFE v1.9.2)，它們將把您帶入一個被遺忘的過去領域，以及支離破碎的命运之中。您可以在我們的 <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f34vebm8r5m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> 上的 '#tbs-versions' 頻道中找到 '<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-broken-script-official\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">破碎的腳本</span></em></a>' 的所有其他版本 ！(從 v0.7.1 到最新版本)。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>在這個模組包中，您會發現一些 <span style=\"color:#fff\">輕量級模組</span>，讓您的體驗看起來像 <span style=\"color:#fff\">ARG</span>，並盡可能<span style=\"color:#707070\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">獨一無二</span></span>，例如'<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/essential-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Essential Mod</a></em></span>'、'<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Voice Chat</a></em></span>'、'<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endofherobrine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The End of Herobrine</a></em></span>'，以及圍繞其背景故事設計的自訂'<span style=\"color:#707070\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">任務</span></em></a></span></span>'，還有更多內容正&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fff\">等待您去探索</span>，只要記得隨時留意您的 '<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><a style=\"color:#ced4d9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sanity-descent-into-madness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>理智值</em></a></span>' 就好！&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#707070\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#707070\"><br></span>在資源包設定中，如果您無法看到自訂資源包，請將模組資源<span style=\"color:#707070\"> <span style=\"color:#fff\">調至更高位置</span> </span>於 Minecraft 之上。<span style=\"color:#707070\"> <br>如果您不喜歡這種 VHS/舊相機效果，只需輸入<span style=\"color:#707070\"> <span style=\"color:#fff\">/removevhs</span></span>即可，建議將<span style=\"color:#707070\"> <span style=\"color:#fff\">GUI 比例設定為 3 或 4</span>。<br>此外，如果您不希望世界出現任何<span style=\"color:#707070\"> <span style=\"color:#fff\">致命事件</span> </span>，請使用<strong> </strong><span style=\"color:#707070\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">/tbs_config</span>&nbsp;</span>指令。<span style=\"color:#707070\"><br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1193609/description_d2cd0454-66ae-4228-a7ff-5b86a71c6423.png\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#707070\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1193609/description_1c596789-1104-4453-b423-ee39006aec0f.png\"><br></span></span></span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1193609/description_8d74f2a3-0975-42c2-9a9d-24cc5b76fa9d.png\"><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xYqHnu1_zSI\" width=\"290\" height=\"163\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> &nbsp; <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0dLaQUYZS-c?t=5s\" width=\"290\" height=\"163\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vFo6G6_J0SY?lc=UgzeMdrbSoSkIJMeLu14AaABAg\" width=\"290\" height=\"163\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> &nbsp; <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e2DOzOTADHg?t=2s\" width=\"290\" height=\"163\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1193609/description_4a9f96eb-e48a-48ab-ba86-9a50cdff9726.png\"></p>",
